<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Watts Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Watts Industries cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Watts Industries Inc to hold from strong buy based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- the stock fell 1-5/16 to 26.</p>
</text>
